[32m[2025-07-27 16:07:00,794] [    INFO][0m - ['he Martian is an exciting, thrilling and inspiring movie that is sure to stimulate the senses. The story follows Mark Watney, a NASA Astronaut who is stranded on Mars after being presumed dead. He must use his skills in science and engineering to survive on the harsh planet and find a way back home. The Martian is a gripping movie that depicts the struggle of survival in an extreme environment, along with the hope of being rescued. The actors and special effects give a realistic feel to the story, making it even more captivating. The movie is certainly a must-watch and a great representation of human ingenuity and resilience.<|eot_id|>\n\n'][0m
