[32m[2025-07-27 16:08:23,982] [    INFO][0m - ['he use of renewable energy is growing rapidly in relevance and importance as the world looks towards solutions to combat climate change. Renewable energy sources, such as solar, wind, and hydropower, are sustainable and have a much lower environmental impact than traditional energy sources like coal and oil. Switching to renewable energy can reduce carbon emissions, improve air quality, lessen the dependence on non-renewable resources, and provide a stable and secure energy future. Renewable energy is essential for achieving a sustainable future and should be an important part of any country’s energy portfolio.<|eot_id|>\n\n'][0m
