[32m[2025-07-27 16:51:19,393] [    INFO][0m - [' computer motherboard is the main circuit board in a computer. It is the backbone of the system, connecting all other components such as the processor, RAM, storage, graphics card and peripheral ports. It provides communication pathways between all of these components, allowing them to interact and work together. The motherboard is responsible for regulating power, and also houses slots for expansion cards, as well as ports for USB, audio, Ethernet, and other connection types.<|eot_id|>\n\n'][0m
