[32m[2025-07-27 18:07:22,724] [    INFO][0m - ['he potential benefits of AI in healthcare include improved diagnosis and treatment, streamlined administrative processes, better patient outcomes, improved access to healthcare services, and cost savings. AI can provide better predictions for disease risk and progression, as well as identify potential treatments for a given patient. It can also reduce costs through automation of administrative tasks, as well as reduce errors in diagnosis and treatment. AI could also increase access to healthcare services, such as providing telehealth solutions or an online health platform.<|eot_id|>\n\n'][0m
