[32m[2025-07-27 18:09:06,165] [    INFO][0m - ['I assistants can help us in daily life by automating tedious and repetitive tasks, helping us remember and stay on top of our commitments and schedules, providing educational and entertainment content, enabling us to be more productive, and providing useful insights. AI assistants can even provide medical and health-related advice. Furthermore, they can enable us to stay better connected with our friends and family and get access to news and content tailored to our specific interests.<|eot_id|>\n\n'][0m
