[32m[2025-07-27 18:09:22,910] [    INFO][0m - [' potential security threat for a global online financial system is cybercrime. Cybercriminals often target online financial systems due to their complexity and the potential to gain access to sensitive data like financial information or credit card numbers. Cybercriminals may use methods like malware, phishing, and identity theft to gain access to a system and steal money or data. It is important for global financial systems to have robust security measures in place to protect against these threats.<|eot_id|>\n\n'][0m
