[32m[2025-07-27 18:09:25,470] [    INFO][0m - ['uccessful entrepreneurs have strong organizational and communication skills, are disciplined, persistent and resilient, and are always looking for ways to innovate. They also possess keen problem-solving and decision-making abilities, demonstrate top-notch customer service and build relationships with stakeholders, and are able to manage their finances and allocate resources prudently. Most importantly, they focus on their long-term vision and goals and never lose sight of them.<|eot_id|>\n\n'][0m
