[32m[2025-08-20 23:27:52,131] [    INFO][0m - Advanced Dental Implants – Next Best Thing to Healthy Natural TeethDental implants are designed to provide a foundation for teeth replacement that look, feel and function like natural teeth. The person, who has lost teeth/tooth, regains the ability to eat anything and can smile with confidence, knowing that teeth appear natural and that facial contours will be preserved.These days advanced dental implants are available at implants clinic in Mohali which provides an attractive and speedy solution to help restore your dental function and improve your smile. As compared to conventional dental implants which take several months before permanent teeth can be fitted, immediate loading implants allow patients to have natural looking and feeling teeth in just 72 hours. The main advantage of advanced dental implants over its conventional counterpart is that patient can eat almost anything from the 3rd day itself without any major surgery or complications.Before we move further, here is the basic idea about dental implants.Dental implant- What is it?A dental implant is a tiny screw shaped titanium fixture which is placed into the jawbone to replace the root of a missing teeth/tooth. The bone bonds with the titanium, creating a strong foundation for artificial teeth. In addition, the dental implant also helps preserve facial structure, preventing the bone deterioration which occurs when teeth are/is missing.Uses of Dental ImplantsDental implants can be used toReplace single missing toothReplace multiple missing teethReplace all missing teethWhy Should Missing Teeth Be Replaced?Several negative things may happen when you lose tooth/teeth. Chewing ability and aesthetic may be lost and teeth start drifting. Replacement of missing teeth from full mouth dental implants clinic not only prevents the collapse of bite but also replaces form and function.3 Stages of Advanced Dental Implant ProcedureStage 1 – 3D image of the patient’s jaw i