[32m[2025-08-29 09:54:47,372] [    INFO][0m - <s> It is done, and submitted. You can play “Survival of the Tastiest” on Android, and on the web. Playing on the web works, but you have to simulate multi-touch for table moving and that can be a bit confusing.There’s a lot I’d like to talk about. I’ll go through every topic, insted of making the typical what went right/wrong list.ConceptWorking over the theme was probably one of the hardest tasks I had to face.Originally, I had an idea of what kind of game I wanted to develop, gameplay wise – something with lots of enemies/actors, simple graphics, maybe set in space, controlled from a top-down view. I was confident I could fit any theme around it.In the end, the problem with a theme like “Evolution” in a game is that evolution is unassisted. It happens through several seemingly random mutations over time, with the most apt permutation surviving. This genetic car simulator is, in my opinion, a great example of actual evolution of a species facing a challenge. But is it a game?In a game, you need to control something to reach an objective[0m
[32m[2025-08-29 09:54:47,373] [    INFO][0m - Sample data for valid mode.[0m
[32m[2025-08-29 09:54:47,377] [    INFO][0m - <s> Kylie Jenner Responds to Better Business Bureau, Company Removes RatingUPDATE (7/6): Kylie Jenner has responded to the Better Business Bureau's failing grade via a post on her website, saying the company has changed its rating. They reportedly switched the F rating to a C and then to a B-, before removing the grade altogether, according to E! News."The company replied that because their product is shipped in highly recognizable packaging, they feel that packages are being vandalized or stolen," Better Business Bureau wrote on its site at the time. "The company also indicated that they were taking steps to change their packaging so that it is less recognizable."You guys are the reason I keep going and I’m motivated every day to make Kylie Cosmetics the best it can be. I’m continuing to learn and I just want to make everyone happy. Because so many of you spoke out, I’m excited to tell you that the Better Business Bureau has looked at the facts and changed the rating.I’ve sold millions of lip kits and any complaint we’ve received to date has been addressed in a timely manner. I’m[0m
